  "idea": "Automated Slack channel cleanup bot for archived project channels",
  "text": "Keep your remote team's communication channels clean and perfectly organized without lifting a finger. Fast-moving teams launch dozens of ephemeral channels each month that turn into digital ghost towns. Critical institutional knowledge becomes fragmented across dead rooms, making historical context retrieval nearly impossible. Deploy an automated Zapier script that archives dormant channels and catalogs their transcripts into Notion. This keeps your workspace organized while preserving key decisions.",
